$$
x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0}, \quad \forall i = 1, \ldots, 25
$$

Where all $p_i$ and $w_i$ are as listed above, and $x_i$ is the number of vehicles of type $i$ to order per day.[0m

